  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several pools called \"Glenwood Pool\" across the United States! Here's a summary of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 1. **Glenwood Pool \u2013 Forest Glen, Maryland**\nGlenwood Pool is a swim club set back among the trees and along a creek in historic Forest Glen, Maryland. You can reach them at **board@glenwoodpool.org** for more information.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf21\ufe0f 2. **Glenwood Hot Springs Resort \u2013 Glenwood Springs, Colorado**\nGlenwood Hot Springs Resort has more than 7 expansive pools on the property, including the original historic pool which is the \"world's largest hot springs pool.\" The historic thermal spring water has been drawing visitors from all over the world since 1888. The source of the mineral water is the Yampah Spring, which produces over 3.5 million gallons of water per day at a temperature of 122\u00b0F.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f 3. **Glenwood Houses Pool \u2013 Brooklyn, New York**\nIf you find yourself in the Glenwood Houses neighborhood of Brooklyn, New York, and crave a swim, the Glenwood Houses Pool offers a place to cool off and enjoy the water during the hot New York summers. Managed by NYC Parks, it is a well-maintained facility that caters to the community's aquatic needs.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 4. **Glenwood Aquatic Center \u2013 Glenwood Springs, Colorado**\nThis 277,000-gallon pool boasts 8 lap lanes and a one-meter diving board, ranging from 4 feet deep to 12 feet deep, with a temperature kept between 82\u201384 degrees. It is located at 100 Wulfsohn Road, Glenwood Springs, CO 81601.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 5. **Glennwood Pool \u2013 Evans, Georgia**\nGlennwood Pool is a non-profit, volunteer-run neighborhood pool in Evans, Georgia, offering memberships for residents and non-residents, seasonal events like dive-in movie nights, and military & senior discounts.\n\n---\n\nCould you let me know which **Glenwood Pool** you're looking for, or what city/state you're in? I can help find more specific information! \ud83d\ude0a",
